===3F (Rare)===
On climbing the ladder up to 3F there is a 0.1% chance of entering a [[Secrets and Easter eggs|secret]] alternative 3F with wild encounters and a fused Mewtwo. The room can be distinguished by its dark haze effect. The Mewtwo fusion in this room is considered the same encounter as the normal Mewtwo fight, so catching either will prevent the other from appearing.
