===Path===
The map below indicates the order, whether it is a ladder or a hole, the player must take to navigate to Mewtwo.<br />
*'''1F''' is divided into four sections, and three of those are only accessible from ladders or holes:
**'''Main part''', accessible from the Cave's entrance, and with both Northern ladders.
**'''South-Western corner''', accessible from Hole #2 and East-Center ladder.
**'''Upper Ground''', accessible from the Center ladder of the Center path and South-Western ladder from South-Western path.
**'''Exit Shortcut''', accessible from Mewtwo's room North-Western ladder.
*'''2F''' is divided into four sections that can only be accessed from ladders:
**'''Eastern path''', accessed from the North-Eastern ladder.
**'''North-Western path''', accessed from the North-Western ladder.
**'''Center path''', accessed from the East-Center ladder.
**'''South-Western path''', accessed from the South-Western ladder on the higher ground.
